    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and beautifully presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground-floor apartment to the market, ideally positioned within the ever-popular Moylaragh Mews development in Balbriggan, Co. Dublin. No. 13 benefits from its own-door entrance and comes to the market in excellent condition throughout. This superb property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers, including first-time purchasers, those looking to trade down, and investors alike.\n\nThe location is second to none, situated within easy reach of Balbriggan Town Centre and an abundance of local amenities including reputable schools, shops, cafés, parks, beaches, and sporting facilities. The area is well serviced by public transport, with Balbriggan Train Station and frequent bus routes nearby, while the M1 motorway provides swift access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nBright and well laid out internal living accommodation of approx. 63 sq.m. comprises of entrance hallway, spacious open-plan kitchen/living/dining area, two generous double bedrooms, main family bathroom, and ensuite. Both bedrooms benefit from fitted wardrobes, while one of the bedrooms provides direct access to a private balcony area.\n\nNo. 13 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and has benefited from a number of upgrades in recent years, including a new kitchen and flooring in 2021 along with a stylish upgraded bathroom. Additional benefits include double-glazed windows, gas-fired central heating, and an electric hob. The development further benefits from an internal communal courtyard with bin area, communal parking, and service charges of approximately 1,300 per annum.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for any buyer seeking a stylish and well-maintained apartment in a highly convenient and sought-after location. Early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0868323302 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing.\n\nKey Features\n• c.63 sq.m\n• BER C3\n• Own Door Entrance\n• 2 Double Bedrooms\n• Fitted Wardrobes\n• Private Balcony\n• Upgraded Kitchen, Flooring and Bathroom in 2021\n• Double Glazed Windows\n• Gas Fired Central Heating\n• Electric Hob\n• Bright Open Plan Kitchen/Living/Dining Area\n• Internal Communal Courtyard\n• Designated Bin Area\n• Communal Parking\n• Service Charge Approx. 1,300 Per Annum\n• Close to Balbriggan Town Centre\n• Easy Access to M1 and Transport Links\n• Ideal for First Time Buyers and Investors\n• Viewing Highly Advised\n\nDirections - K32 W225"
      },
      {
